<section class="fragment-plan" data-artifact="plan" data-slice="extra-time-penalties" data-rev="0">
  <table class="files-touched pl-files">
    <thead><tr><th>File</th><th>Status</th><th>Module</th><th>Lines</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr class="is-modified"><td><details><summary><span class="pl-chip">config</span> content/rules/default.json, data/rules.rs, content/README.md</summary><div class="pl-card">Rule pack schema 3 with an extra_time block (two 15-minute periods, 300 seconds of added time at most, one extra substitution, one extra window) and a shootout block (five kicks).</div></details></td><td>modified</td><td>data</td><td>+97 / -5</td></tr>
      <tr class="is-modified"><td><details><summary><span class="pl-chip">domain</span> rules/clock.rs, rules/mod.rs</summary><div class="pl-card">The clock moves from halves to periods, so minute 105 reads 105; a level knockout match opens an extra-time break through the half-time path, and a level extra time starts the shoot-out.</div></details></td><td>modified</td><td>rules</td><td>+150 / -40</td></tr>
      <tr class="is-new"><td><details><summary><span class="pl-chip">domain</span> rules/shootout.rs</summary><div class="pl-card">Pure law functions: eligible kickers with numbers equalised, kicker order, alternation, the early decision, sudden death. The kick itself waits for Q-1.</div></details></td><td>new</td><td>rules</td><td>+220</td></tr>
      <tr class="is-modified"><td><details><summary><span class="pl-chip">domain</span> sim.rs, snapshot.rs, observe/mod.rs, scenario.rs, rng.rs</summary><div class="pl-card">Knockout switch off by default; period and shoot-out event fields; snapshot version 2; extra-time and shoot-out statistics as additive extras; test scene methods; the shoot-out draw.</div></details></td><td>modified</td><td>engine</td><td>+187 / -9</td></tr>
      <tr class="is-external"><td><details><summary><span class="pl-chip">domain</span> fatigue and change-queue modules (written by the tactics slice)</summary><div class="pl-card">Fatigue driven by elapsed playing time through 120 minutes; the substitution limit and windows rise when extra time starts.</div></details></td><td>external</td><td>tactics</td><td>+35 / -7</td></tr>
      <tr class="is-modified"><td><details><summary><span class="pl-chip">contract</span> crates/protocol event.rs, message.rs, docs/reference/protocol.md</summary><div class="pl-card">Optional fields on existing events; no new event type; protocol version unchanged under options A and B.</div></details></td><td>modified</td><td>protocol</td><td>+70 / -2</td></tr>
      <tr class="is-modified"><td><details><summary><span class="pl-chip">service</span> engine-cli cli.rs, simulate.rs, bench.rs, serve.rs, record.rs</summary><div class="pl-card">A --knockout flag on the commands that build a match.</div></details></td><td>modified</td><td>cli</td><td>+18 / -1</td></tr>
      <tr class="is-new"><td><details><summary><span class="pl-chip">test</span> tests/rules_extra_time.rs, rules_shootout.rs, fatigue_curve.rs; content.rs and snapshot.rs (modified)</summary><div class="pl-card">A forced draw runs extra time and a shoot-out to one winner; the sixth substitution applies in extra time and a seventh is rejected; the fatigue curve has no step at minute 90; a snapshot resumes through extra time.</div></details></td><td>new</td><td>tests</td><td>+540 / -2</td></tr>
    </tbody>
