  <div class="pl-risks">
    <aside class="callout callout-warn"><div class="callout-hd">R1 · Q-1 open: how the shoot-out is simulated</div><div class="callout-body">Draws step outside the positional model the product owner ratified; on-pitch kicks make the announced length unbounded under sudden death. The plan is awaiting input with three options recorded.</div></aside>
    <aside class="callout callout-warn"><div class="callout-hd">R2 · Fatigue and substitution code does not exist yet</div><div class="callout-body">Two of three criteria extend the tactics slice's code. An auto-review of this plan runs after that slice is verified.</div></aside>
    <aside class="callout callout-info"><div class="callout-hd">R3 · A missed field breaks resume in extra time</div><div class="callout-body">Snapshot version 2 and a continuation test from the break before extra time.</div></aside>
    <aside class="callout callout-info"><div class="callout-hd">R4 · Knockout matches are longer</div><div class="callout-body">At most 480,000 ticks, only when --knockout is set; the default match and the benchmark are unchanged.</div></aside>
